---
import { site } from '../../lib/site';
---
<section class="hero" id="inicio" data-ink="#1f1f1f">
  <h1 class="sr-only">Tato Studio: cine con IA hecho en Perú</h1>
  <div class="hero__pin" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="hero__word hero__word--tl">Tato</span>
    <span class="hero__word hero__word--br">Studio</span>
  </div>

  <div class="hero__screens">
    <div class="hero__stage">
      <div class="hero__paper">
        <p class="hero__lead lead" data-rise style="--i:0">Te enseño a crear los videos con IA que ves en mi TikTok, o te hago el tuyo. Desde Huaraz, Ica y Lima.</p>
        <div class="hero__actions" data-rise style="--i:1">
          <a class="button" href="#aprende">Quiero aprender</a>
          <a class="link-plain medium" href="#tu-video">Quiero mi video</a>
        </div>
        <nav class="hero__side small medium" aria-label="Atajos">
          <a class="link" href="#videos">Videos</a>
          <a class="link" href="#marcas">Marcas</a>
          <a class="link" href="#sobre-mi">Sobre mí</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero__clip shutter" data-reveal>
        <video data-loop muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/poster/transformacion.jpg" width="720" height="1280" aria-label="Tato en el gimnasio se convierte en un héroe con armadura blanca; hecho con Seedance 2.0">
          <source src="/video/transformacion.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="hero__second">
      <div class="hero__text">
        <p class="hero__statement" data-reveal>Soy Carlos. Entreno en Huaraz, hago cine con IA y mi primer video viral fui yo, convertido en héroe.</p>
        <p data-reveal style="--i:1">Sin cámara, sin actores y sin estudio: un prompt bien escrito y una app. Eso es lo que enseño en los talleres y lo que hago para parejas, familias y negocios.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero__clip2">
        <video data-loop muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" poster="/poster/gym.jpg" width="720" height="1280" aria-label="Carlos entrenando con mancuernas en un gimnasio de Huaraz">
          <source src="/video/gym.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; }
  .hero__pin { position: sticky; top: 0; height: 100svh; z-index: 5; pointer-events: none; }
  .hero__word { position: absolute; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: var(--step-display); line-height: 0.85; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .hero__word--tl { top: 28px; left: 28px; margin-left: -0.05em; color: var(--ink); }
  .hero__word--br { bottom: 28px; right: 28px; color: var(--color-red); }
  .hero__screens { margin-top: -100svh; }

  .hero__stage { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr)); column-gap: var(--gutter); height: 100svh; }
  .hero__paper { grid-column: 1 / span 9; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(9, minmax(0, 1fr)); column-gap: var(--gutter); align-content: start; background: var(--bg); padding-top: 44svh; position: relative; }
  .hero__lead { grid-column: 3 / span 5; max-width: 34ch; }
  .hero__actions { grid-column: 3 / span 6; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .hero__side { position: absolute; right: var(--gutter); top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; text-align: right; }
  .hero__clip { grid-column: 10 / span 3; height: 100svh; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; background: var(--ink); position: relative; }
  .hero__clip video { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 30%; }

  .hero__second { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr)); column-gap: var(--gutter); min-height: 100svh; }
  .hero__text { grid-column: 1 / span 6; background: var(--surface); padding: calc(var(--step-display) * 0.85 + 72px) var(--margin) 4rem calc(var(--margin) + 28px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 1.2rem; }
  .hero__statement { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.4vw, 2.25rem); line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.01em; max-width: 27ch; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .hero__clip2 { grid-column: 7 / span 6; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; background: var(--ink); min-height: 100svh; position: relative; }
  .hero__clip2 video { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 40%; }

  @media (max-width: 47.99em) {
    .hero__pin { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 100svh; }
    .hero__word { font-size: 15vw; }
    .hero__word--tl { top: 16px; left: 16px; }
    .hero__word--br { bottom: 16px; right: 16px; }
    .hero__screens { margin-top: 0; }
    .hero__stage { display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100svh; padding: calc(15vw + 28px) 0 calc(15vw + 32px); }
    .hero__paper { display: block; padding: 0 16px; flex: none; }
    .hero__lead { max-width: 100%; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.4; }
    .hero__actions { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .hero__side { display: none; }
    .hero__clip { order: -1; flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 0; height: auto; margin: 0 16px; }
    .hero__second { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 0; }
    .hero__clip2 { order: -1; min-height: 0; height: 56svh; }
    .hero__text { padding: 2rem 16px 2.5rem; }
  }
</style>
